    <string name="about_app_title">About Pony Paper</string>
    <string name="about_app_message">Pony Paper is a live wallpaper (and optional screen saver) using pixel-art sprites of characters from My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic.\n\nThis is a modernization fork of Smithers888/PonyPaper for current Android (Gradle, modern SDK levels). It installs under application id io.github.derram.ponypaper and does not replace the original app.\n\nFork features include target frame rate, Battery Saver and on-battery options, hold-to-drag ponies, optional screensaver clock (Lexend), custom pony import, and stability fixes.\n\nOpen Licenses &amp; credits for project links and full license texts.</string>

    <string name="license_art_title">Artwork &amp; original source</string>
    <string name="license_art_message">All artwork was created by contributors to the Desktop Ponies team (DeviantArt and the Desktop-Ponies source repository). Artwork and the original source are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0).\n\nOriginal Android source: Smithers888 / Smithers888/PonyPaper.\n\nYou may share and modify this project under the same terms: credit, non-commercial use, and share-alike.\n\nUse the project links on the previous screen for Desktop Ponies, the art team, upstream Pony Paper, and the full CC deed.</string>

    <string name="license_lexend_header">Lexend is used for the optional screensaver clock (Lexend Medium and Lexend SemiBold, bundled under assets/font/).\n\nCopyright 2018 The Lexend Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/lexend), with Reserved Font Name \u201cRevReading Lexend\u201d.\n\nThis Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Full license text follows.\n\n</string>

